"14:51", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1801.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "That Allah may repay each soul what it hath earned. Lo! Allah is swift at reckoning.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Çünkü Allah, herkesi kazandığı ile cezalandıracaktır. Gerçekten Allah, hesabı çabuk görendir.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اس لیے کہ اللہ ہر جان کو اس کی کمائی کا بدلہ دے، بیشک اللہ کو حساب کرتے کچھ دیر نہیں لگتی،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "agar Allah memberi pembalasan kepada tiap-tiap orang terhadap apa yang ia usahakan. Sesungguhnya Allah Maha cepat hisab-Nya.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "لِيَجْزِىَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/73ecf8610a0ce851f335.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "so that he/it may reward", "bs": "da nagradi", "tr": "ödüllendirsin diye", "fr": "qu'il récompense", "id": "agar dia membalas", "ur": "تاکہ وہ بدلہ دے", "bn": "যাতে সে পুরস্কৃত করে", "fa": "تا پاداش دهد"}}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كُلَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "نَفْسٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كَسَبَتْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "سَرِيعُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْحِسَابِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "34:17", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3623.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "This We awarded them because of their ingratitude. Punish We ever any save the ingrates?", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Bunu onlara nankörlüklerinin cezası yaptık ve biz hep böyle çok nankör olanları cezalandırırız.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "ہم نے انہیں یہ بدلہ دیا ان کی ناشکری کی سزا، اور ہم کسے سزا دیتے ہیں اسی کو جو نا شکرا ہے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Demikianlah Kami memberi balasan kepada mereka karena kekafiran mereka. Dan Kami tidak menjatuhkan azab (yang demikian itu), melainkan hanya kepada orang-orang yang sangat kafir.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "ذَٰلِكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "جَزَيْنَٰهُم", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/277c101a63cdf9fae112.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "we repaid them", "bs": "uzvratili smo im", "tr": "onlara karşılık verdik", "fr": "nous leur avons rendu", "id": "kami telah membalas mereka", "ur": "ہم نے انہیں بدلہ دیا", "bn": "আমরা তাদের প্রতিদান দিয়েছি", "fa": "آنان را جزا دادیم"}}, {"text": "بِمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كَفَرُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَهَلْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "نُجَٰزِىٓ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْكَفُورَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "23:111", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "ana", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2784.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Lo! I have rewarded them this day forasmuch as they were steadfast in that they, even they, are the triumphant.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Bugün ben onlara, sabrettiklerinin karşılığını verdim; onlar, hakikaten muradlarına erenlerdir.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "بیشک آج میں نے ان کے صبر کا انہیں یہ بدلہ دیا کہ وہی کامیاب ہیں،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Sesungguhnya Aku memberi balasan kepada mereka di hari ini, karena kesabaran mereka; sesungguhnya mereka itulah orang-orang yang menang\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "إِنِّى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "جَزَيْتُهُمُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/0cc58d2d34ede47b673b.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "I rewarded them", "bs": "nagradio sam ih", "tr": "onları ödüllendirdim", "fr": "je les ai récompensés", "id": "aku telah membalas mereka", "ur": "میں نے انہیں بدلہ دیا", "bn": "আমি তাদের পুরস্কৃত করেছি", "fa": "آنان را پاداش دادم"}}, {"text": "ٱلْيَوْمَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "صَبَرُوٓا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَنَّهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هُمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْفَآئِزُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "76:12", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5603.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And hath awarded them for all that they endured, a Garden and silk attire;", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Sabırlarına karşılık onlara bir cennet ve ipekten elbiseler verir.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور ان کے صبر پر انہیں جنت اور ریشمی کپڑے صلہ میں دیے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan Dia memberi balasan kepada mereka karena kesabaran mereka (dengan) surga dan (pakaian) sutera,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَجَزَىٰهُم", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/94e5e7d995362fdf5ce2.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i nagradio ih je", "en": "and He rewarded them", "tr": "ve onları ödüllendirdi", "fr": "et Il les a récompensés", "id": "dan Dia membalas mereka", "ur": "اور اس نے انہیں بدلہ دیا", "bn": "এবং তিনি তাদের প্রতিদান দিলেন", "fa": "و به آنان پاداش داد"}}, {"text": "بِمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "صَبَرُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "جَنَّةً", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَحَرِيرًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "نَجْزِى", "count": 19, "first": "6:84", "audio": "audio/1ebe9880cd91fb37ed34.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"bs": "nagrađujemo", "en": "We reward", "tr": "karşılığını veriyoruz", "fr": "Nous récompensons", "id": "Kami membalas", "ur": "ہم بدلہ دیتے ہیں", "bn": "আমরা প্রতিদান দিই", "fa": "پاداش می‌دهیم"}}, {"arabic": "تُجْزَوْنَ", "count": 9, "first": "6:93", "audio": "audio/d842c4bccefc612636ec.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": true, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "you (all) are repaid", "bs": "biva vam uzvraćeno", "tr": "size karşılık verilir", "fr": "vous serez récompensés", "id": "kalian dibalas", "ur": "تمہیں بدلہ دیا جاتا ہے", "bn": "তোমাদের প্রতিদান দেওয়া হয়", "fa": "به شما جزا داده می‌شود"}}, {"arabic": "لِيَجْزِىَ", "count": 5, "first": "10:4", "audio": "audio/1bdaa79a3369ae328b52.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "subjunctive"}], "gloss": {"en": "so that he/it may reward", "bs": "da nagradi", "tr": "ödüllendirsin diye", "fr": "qu'il récompense", "id": "agar dia membalas", "ur": "تاکہ وہ بدلہ دے", "bn": "যাতে সে পুরস্কৃত করে", "fa": "تا پاداش دهد"}}, {"arabic": "يُجْزَوْنَ", "count": 3, "first": "7:147", "audio": "audio/901ecbb0905f4c1ec54a.m4a", "